					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TRANSPORT BEAT\n\nThe Transport Beat node sends out the beats as triggers. \nThis is by far the easiest way to sync your modulation to the BPM. \n\nPress the play transport button to start the patch. \n\nCheck out the Transport Tick node if you need more control over the beat data. Press play to start the transport."
